WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.493 --> 00:00:14.134
While Dr.

2
00:00:14.194 --> 00:00:17.975
Dolittle studied the leaf, Tommy and Charles picked more fruit.

3
00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:21.317
"The men in the mountains will be hungry," said Charles.

4
00:00:21.337 --> 00:00:23.158
"They will want something to eat."

5
00:00:23.178 --> 00:00:25.279
"Good thinking, Charles!"

6
00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:27.960
Dr. Dolittle patted him on the shoulder.

7
00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:35.059
Then the doctor let out such a cry that Tommy dropped two pieces of fruit.

8
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.861
"It's Long Arrow!"

9
00:00:37.281 --> 00:00:37.901
he shouted.

10
00:00:37.921 --> 00:00:40.223
"Where?" Charles looked around.

11
00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:41.764
"No, here!

12
00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:42.725
He's here!"

13
00:00:43.185 --> 00:00:43.785
said Dr.

14
00:00:43.825 --> 00:00:45.827
Dolittle as he pointed to the leaf.

15
00:00:47.168 --> 00:00:49.009
Everyone stood around the doctor.

16
00:00:49.029 --> 00:00:50.450
"How do you know?"

17
00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:51.571
asked Tommy.

18
00:00:52.831 --> 00:00:54.693
The doctor pointed to one drawing.

19
00:00:55.313 --> 00:00:56.994
Tommy couldn't tell what it was.

20
00:00:57.014 --> 00:01:00.049
"This is an eagle's nest," Dr.

21
00:01:00.069 --> 00:01:01.049
Dolittle explained.

22
00:01:01.069 --> 00:01:03.512
"Inside the nest is a man.

23
00:01:03.912 --> 00:01:05.153
That's Long Arrow.

24
00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:09.016
Everyone knows he is close friends with the eagles."

25
00:01:09.897 --> 00:01:11.178
Tommy didn't know that.

26
00:01:12.099 --> 00:01:15.662
The doctor stood up and said, "We have no time to waste!

27
00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:17.684
Long Arrow is in danger.

28
00:01:18.084 --> 00:01:18.965
He needs our help."

29
00:01:18.985 --> 00:01:20.767
"It looks like he's up there."

30
00:01:21.027 --> 00:01:22.548
Charles pointed to the mountains.

31
00:01:23.229 --> 00:01:23.829
"But where?

32
00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:25.411
The mountains are so big!"

33
00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:26.472
said Tommy.

34
00:01:28.592 --> 00:01:31.033
Again the doctor showed him the leaf drawing.

35
00:01:31.053 --> 00:01:32.914
"See the mountain top?

36
00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:34.855
It looks like a hawk's head.

37
00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:36.716
That's where they are!"

38
00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:37.576
he said.

39
00:01:38.316 --> 00:01:42.338
Without another word, everyone started running toward the mountains.

40
00:01:42.358 --> 00:01:45.640
"Wait! Let's take the jabizri!"

41
00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.661
the doctor called out suddenly.

42
00:01:47.681 --> 00:01:51.282
"Here it is," said Tommy.

43
00:01:51.983 --> 00:01:54.624
Tommy held up a fruit that looked like an orange.

44
00:01:55.304 --> 00:01:59.066
He had made a small cut on top and scraped out all the flesh.

45
00:01:59.687 --> 00:02:04.829
He placed the insect inside and put the cut out part back in place—like a lid.

46
00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:06.830
The doctor smiled at him.

47
00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.332
"What a clever boy you are!"

48
00:02:09.732 --> 00:02:10.252
he said.

49
00:02:11.853 --> 00:02:14.635
Climbing up the mountain was long and difficult.

50
00:02:15.195 --> 00:02:19.617
Tommy's legs were shaking so badly that he wanted to sit down and rest.

51
00:02:20.118 --> 00:02:22.419
But Long Arrow and his men needed them.

52
00:02:23.019 --> 00:02:24.120
They had to go on.

53
00:02:24.984 --> 00:02:26.625
After many hours, Dr.

54
00:02:26.686 --> 00:02:29.608
Dolittle and the others finally made it to the top.

55
00:02:30.549 --> 00:02:32.970
"Look for the hawk's head," said Dr.

56
00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:37.494
Dolittle. They looked and looked but saw nothing like a hawk's head.

57
00:02:37.514 --> 00:02:43.739
"Doctor," Polynesia said carefully, "maybe we should try again tomorrow.

58
00:02:44.239 --> 00:02:45.360
It's getting dark."

59
00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.943
"We will find Long Arrow tonight," Dr.

60
00:02:48.983 --> 00:02:50.284
Dolittle said firmly.

61
00:02:51.896 --> 00:02:53.418
No one spoke for a while.

62
00:02:53.698 --> 00:02:54.338
Then Dr.

63
00:02:54.398 --> 00:02:56.020
Dolittle snapped his fingers.

64
00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.421
"That's it!"

65
00:02:57.701 --> 00:02:58.322
he shouted.

66
00:02:58.342 --> 00:03:01.285
"Tommy! Let the jabizri go."

67
00:03:02.025 --> 00:03:05.008
Tommy wanted to keep the beautiful insect as a pet.

68
00:03:05.028 --> 00:03:09.552
"The jabizri will lead us to Long Arrow," said the doctor.

69
00:03:10.293 --> 00:03:15.037
So Tommy took the lid off the fruit and watched as the jabizri crawled out.

70
00:03:15.057 --> 00:03:18.400
"Keep your eye on it," instructed the doctor.

71
00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:24.485
The jabizri stretched its six legs then walked around in a circle three times.

72
00:03:24.505 --> 00:03:25.946
"What's it doing?"

73
00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.688
Charles cried impatiently.

74
00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:31.271
"The poor thing is stretching," said Polynesia.

75
00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:35.194
"It was trapped in that fruit for a very long time."

76
00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:39.458
Finally the jabizri began to move.

77
00:03:40.279 --> 00:03:43.001
Dr. Dolittle and the others followed it downward.

78
00:03:43.822 --> 00:03:45.944
It led them to one side of the mountain.

79
00:03:46.856 --> 00:03:49.578
Then the jabizri disappeared inside a crack.

80
00:03:49.598 --> 00:03:51.639
"Now what do we do?"

81
00:03:52.419 --> 00:03:53.240
moaned Charles.

82
00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.282
But the doctor was busy examining the crack in the mountain.

83
00:03:57.302 --> 00:04:01.344
"This looks like an entrance," Dr.

84
00:04:01.384 --> 00:04:02.125
Dolittle said.

85
00:04:02.145 --> 00:04:03.906
"Dr. Dolittle!"

86
00:04:04.186 --> 00:04:06.847
Tommy cried excitedly as he pointed down.

87
00:04:07.368 --> 00:04:10.229
They had been standing on the hawk's head all along.

88
00:04:10.249 --> 00:04:14.632
"Then Long Arrow must be the doctor looked all around.

89
00:04:15.532 --> 00:04:16.153
"In here!

90
00:04:16.413 --> 00:04:17.373
This is a cave!

91
00:04:17.553 --> 00:04:20.035
This rock must have fallen and blocked the entrance!"

92
00:04:20.876 --> 00:04:23.317
The doctor started to bang against the rock.

93
00:04:23.337 --> 00:04:27.120
"Hurry! We don't have much time!"

94
00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.661
shouted Polynesia.

95
00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:32.424
Dr. Dolittle and Charles tried to push the rock.

96
00:04:33.064 --> 00:04:33.985
It wouldn't budge.

97
00:04:34.645 --> 00:04:38.288
Tommy noticed the bottom of the rock was resting on soft ground.

98
00:04:38.308 --> 00:04:40.449
"Doctor!" he shouted.

99
00:04:40.469 --> 00:04:44.652
"If we remove this dirt, maybe the rock will fall down by itself."

100
00:04:46.424 --> 00:04:47.725
"Good idea, Tommy!"

101
00:04:48.085 --> 00:04:49.085
the doctor replied.

102
00:04:49.685 --> 00:04:53.126
They all got on their knees and started to dig away the dirt.

103
00:04:54.047 --> 00:04:57.028
Soon the big rock started to shake back and forth.

104
00:04:57.048 --> 00:04:58.968
"Get out of the way!"

105
00:04:59.208 --> 00:05:00.089
cried the doctor.

106
00:05:00.829 --> 00:05:04.870
They watched as the giant rock fell away from the mountain and crashed.

107
00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.772
It had indeed been covering the entrance to a cave.
